{title: Pehli Baar Mile Hain}
{artist: S P Balsubramaniam Saajan Nadeeem Saajan91 Shravan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Pehli Baar Mile Hai
[F]Milte [G]Hi Dil [F]Ne Kaha
[G]Mujhe Pyar [Am]Ho Gaya
[Am]Tumne Pyar Se Dekha
[F]Jabse [G]Mujhe [F]Mera Dil
[G]Bekaraar [Am]Ho Gaya
[Am]Kal Tak [G]Jiske Sapne Dekhe
[G]Aaj Woh [F]Mere Saath Hai
[F]Mujhko Ab Yeh [G]Hosh Nahi Hai
[G]Yeh Din Hai [Am]Ke Raat Hai
[Am]Aashiq Tera [G]Dil Hai Mera
[G]Karta Hai [F]Yeh Aashiqui
[F]Tu Hai [G]Chanchal Shok Haseena
[G]Tu Hai [Am]Meri Zindagi
[Am]Tere Pyar Mein Jaanam
[F]Mera [G]Har Din [F]Har Pal
[G]Gulzaar [Am]Ho Gaya
[Am]Chhodo [G]Saari Sharm-O-Haya
[G]Tum Pyar Se [F]Bhi Kutch Kaam Lo
[F]Aaisa Mauka [G]Jane Na Do
[G]Meri Baahen [Am]Thaam Lo
[Am]Har Seene Ki [G]Dhadkan Main Hu
[G]Har Dil [F]Mujhpe Hai Fida
[F]Lekin Mere [G]Dil Ko Bhaaye
[G]Zaalim Teri [Am]Hi Adaa
[Am]Dil Pe Aaj Hamare
[F]Ab [G]Toh [F]Sanam Tera [G]Ikhtiyaar [Am]Ho Gaya
[Am]Dilkash Aankhen [G]Nikhra Chehra
[G]Sheeshe Jaisa [F]Yeh Badan
[F]Aaise Chamke [G]Roop Tumhara
[G]Jaise Paani [Am]Mein Kiran
[Am]Shaharon Ki In [G]Galiyon Mein Hai
[G]Charche Tere [F]Naam Ke
[F]Itne Saare [G]Husn Ke Jalwe
[G]Pyar Bina [Am]Kis Kaam Ke
[Am]Mujhko Gale Se Laga Lo
[F]Jaan-E-Jana [G]Mera [F]Dil [G]Bejaar [Am]Ho Gaya
